					"outputDataExample": "{\"status\": \"Output written to stdout\"}"
				}
			],
			"description": "<ul><li>Core function: <code>rg <PATTERN> PATH</code> recursively searches for a regex pattern in files</li><li>- Defaults to searching the current directory if no path is specified, providing a seamless user experience for codebases</li><li>- Uses a high-performance regex engine built in Rust for speed</li><li>- Implemented via parallel directory traversal (<code>walk_parallel</code> in <code>crates/core/main</li><li>rs</code>) and a <code>Searcher</code> worker that orchestrates matching</li></ul>",
