		"Automatically filter files based on .gitignore, hidden status, and binary content": {
			"name": "Automatically filter files based on .gitignore, hidden status, and binary content",
			"simSteps": [
				{
					"simStepId": "17258a40-341b-47fc-b8e6-6bdbbf1759d3",
					"diagramNodeId": "0c0ae16f-ce03-4b45-8001-fd6d86c88c26",
					"simStepLabel": "File Filtering Flow: Configure Directory Walker",
					"simStepDescription": "Based on command-line arguments (or their absence), a `WalkBuilder` is configured. By default, it's set to respect `.gitignore`, `.ignore`, and `.rgignore` files, and to skip hidden files. Flags like `--no-ignore` or `--hidden` (`-.`) would change these settings. The `-u` flag (`--unrestricted`) is a shortcut to disable filtering; `-u` is like `--no-ignore`, and `-uu` is like `--no-ignore --hidden`.",
					"isEdge": 0,
					"sourceCodeMapping": {
						"filePath": "crates/core/flags/hiargs.rs",
						"startLine": "889",
						"endLine": "901",
						"relevantVariables": [
							"walk_builder",
							"builder.hidden",
							"builder.parents",
							"builder.ignore",
							"builder.git_global",
							"builder.git_ignore",
							"builder.git_exclude",
							"builder.require_git",
							"builder.ignore_case_insensitive"
						]
					},
					"inputDataExample": "{\"args\": {\"hidden\": false, \"no_ignore_parent\": false, \"no_ignore_dot\": false, \"no_ignore_vcs\": false}}",
					"outputDataExample": "{\"WalkBuilder_config\": {\"hidden\": true, \"parents\": true, \"ignore\": true, \"git_global\": true, \"git_ignore\": true, \"git_exclude\": true}}"
				},
				{
					"simStepId": "1fa4ede1-d9a1-4edf-8443-a5878a24d62d",
