		"Customize search result output with context, line/column numbers, and JSON": {
			"name": "Customize search result output with context, line/column numbers, and JSON",
			"simSteps": [
				{
					"simStepId": "aaf4906a-6ce5-4590-aaae-1baaa1b68131",
					"diagramNodeId": "d48d9d48-4e13-4dce-8fe6-b2346af1a6f1",
					"simStepLabel": "Flow 1 - Standard Output: Parse Context and Formatting Flags",
					"simStepDescription": "The application starts by parsing command-line arguments such as `-C 1` (context), `-n` (line numbers), and `--column`. These flags are defined in `defs.rs` and the parser updates a `LowArgs` struct to reflect the user's desired output format.",
					"isEdge": 0,
					"sourceCodeMapping": {
						"filePath": "crates/core/flags/defs.rs",
						"startLine": "1022",
						"endLine": "1025",
						"relevantVariables": [
							"Context",
							"update",
							"args.context.set_both"
						]
					},
					"inputDataExample": "{\"args\": [\"rg\", \"-C\", \"1\", \"-n\", \"--column\", \"Watson\", \"sherlock.txt\"]}",
					"outputDataExample": "{\"LowArgs\": {\"context\": {\"mode\": \"Limited\", \"both\": 1}, \"line_number\": true, \"column\": true, \"mode\": \"Search(Standard)\"}}"
				},
				{
					"simStepId": "c02930b0-acb3-4acb-82aa-f12fd73c7958",
					"diagramNodeId": "eced0960-84f0-4891-a161-39ce420e3eb4",
					"simStepLabel": "Flow 1 - Standard Output: Propagate Low-Level Config",
					"simStepDescription": "The parsed `LowArgs` configuration is processed and transformed into a `HiArgs` struct. This higher-level configuration is used to orchestrate the various components of the search process, like the searcher and the printer.",
					"isEdge": 1,
					"sourceCodeMapping": {
						"filePath": "crates/core/flags/hiargs.rs",
						"startLine": "153",
						"endLine": "527",
						"relevantVariables": [
							"HiArgs",
							"from_low_args"
						]
					},
					"inputDataExample": "{\"LowArgs\": {\"context\": {\"mode\": \"Limited\", \"both\": 1}, \"line_number\": true, \"column\": true, \"mode\": \"Search(Standard)\"}}",
					"outputDataExample": "{\"LowArgs\": {\"context\": {\"mode\": \"Limited\", \"both\": 1}, \"line_number\": true, \"column\": true, \"mode\": \"Search(Standard)\"}}"
				},
				{
					"simStepId": "ff303172-79ee-466d-a025-3e7cb3b8bd1f",
					"diagramNodeId": "10744c57-f84c-492e-b79f-784999aee8df",
					"simStepLabel": "Flow 1 - Standard Output: Configure Searcher",
					"simStepDescription": "The `HiArgs` configuration is used to build a `Searcher`. The `SearcherBuilder` is configured with the number of context lines to show before and after a match (`-C 1` results in 1 line before and 1 after) and to enable line number tracking (`-n`).",
					"isEdge": 0,
					"sourceCodeMapping": {
						"filePath": "crates/core/flags/hiargs.rs",
						"startLine": "722",
						"endLine": "734",
						"relevantVariables": [
							"searcher",
							"SearcherBuilder",
							"builder.line_number",
							"builder.before_context",
							"builder.after_context",
							"limited.get()"
						]
					},
					"inputDataExample": "{\"HiArgs\": {\"context\": \"Limited(both: 1)\", \"line_number\": true}}",
					"outputDataExample": "{\"Searcher\": {\"config\": {\"after_context\": 1, \"before_context\": 1, \"line_number\": true}}}"
				},
				{
					"simStepId": "58734a8a-0dea-4e6c-8a97-10fb4edbc556",
					"diagramNodeId": "f74e6869-9dfb-4ab5-b418-eee1967ff1b7",
					"simStepLabel": "Flow 1 - Standard Output: Select and Configure Standard Printer",
					"simStepDescription": "Based on the absence of the `--json` flag, the `HiArgs::printer` method selects the `Standard` printer. It then calls `printer_standard` to configure a `StandardBuilder` with settings from `HiArgs`, such as enabling column numbers.",
					"isEdge": 1,
					"sourceCodeMapping": {
						"filePath": "crates/core/flags/hiargs.rs",
						"startLine": "585",
						"endLine": "587",
						"relevantVariables": [
							"printer",
							"SearchMode::Standard",
							"self.printer_standard(wtr)"
						]
					},
					"inputDataExample": "{\"HiArgs\": {\"column\": true, \"context_separator\": \"--\", \"search_mode\": \"Standard\"}}",
					"outputDataExample": "{\"HiArgs\": {\"column\": true, \"context_separator\": \"--\", \"search_mode\": \"Standard\"}}"
				},
				{
					"simStepId": "9eec98ce-5973-4486-ad24-908bd31cb6ee",
					"diagramNodeId": "c47986cb-26b4-49cc-ab66-12d7070bccb7",
					"simStepLabel": "Flow 1 - Standard Output: Build Standard Printer",
					"simStepDescription": "The `printer_standard` method uses a `StandardBuilder` to construct the final `Standard` printer. It applies configurations for features like column numbers, context separators, and colors before creating the printer instance.",
					"isEdge": 0,
					"sourceCodeMapping": {
						"filePath": "crates/core/flags/hiargs.rs",
						"startLine": "604",
						"endLine": "657",
						"relevantVariables": [
							"printer_standard",
							"StandardBuilder",
							"builder.column",
							"builder.separator_context",
							"builder.build(wtr)"
						]
					},
					"inputDataExample": "{\"builder_config\": {\"column\": true, \"context_separator\": [45, 45]}}",
					"outputDataExample": "{\"StandardPrinter\": {\"config\": {\"column\": true, \"separator_context\": \"--\"}}}"
				},
				{
					"simStepId": "905e58a3-7fef-4fbb-8262-b20e2f13f95b",
					"diagramNodeId": "739d06fc-85bf-49d2-92d0-b457891a3997",
					"simStepLabel": "Flow 1 - Standard Output: Send Search Results to Sink",
					"simStepDescription": "The configured `Searcher` runs and finds matches and their surrounding context lines. For each result, it invokes the appropriate method (`matched`, `context`, or `context_break`) on the `StandardSink`, passing along the relevant data like line content, line numbers, and match locations.",
					"isEdge": 1,
					"sourceCodeMapping": {
						"filePath": "crates/printer/src/standard.rs",
						"startLine": "789",
						"endLine": "825",
						"relevantVariables": [
							"Sink::matched",
							"Sink::context",
							"Sink::context_break"
						]
					},
					"inputDataExample": "{\"SinkContext\": {\"bytes\": \"Holmeses, success in the province of detective work must always\\n\", \"line_number\": 2, \"absolute_byte_offset\": 65, \"kind\": \"After\"}}",
					"outputDataExample": "{\"SinkContext\": {\"bytes\": \"Holmeses, success in the province of detective work must always\\n\", \"line_number\": 2, \"absolute_byte_offset\": 65, \"kind\": \"After\"}}"
				},
				{
					"simStepId": "09287ee8-73a7-4757-b92d-68d88304d0d2",
					"diagramNodeId": "4a8f3082-dae3-4d64-b8cc-5daa3388cf07",
					"simStepLabel": "Flow 1 - Standard Output: Format Text Output",
					"simStepDescription": "The `StandardSink` receives match and context data and formats it for human-readable output. It prepends line numbers and column numbers to matching lines, uses different separators for match (`:`) versus context (`-`) lines, and inserts a context break separator (`--`) between disconnected result blocks.",
					"isEdge": 0,
					"sourceCodeMapping": {
						"filePath": "crates/printer/src/standard.rs",
						"startLine": "866",
						"endLine": "877",
						"relevantVariables": [
