					"simStepLabel": "Preprocessor Search: Parse --pre and --pre-glob flags",
					"simStepDescription": "The command-line arguments are parsed. When `--pre <CMD>` is used, the command is stored. If `--pre-glob` is used, the glob patterns are also stored. These tell ripgrep to process certain files with an external command before searching.",
					"isEdge": 0,
					"sourceCodeMapping": {
						"filePath": "crates/core/flags/defs.rs",
						"startLine": "5528",
