			"description": "<ul><li>- Use the <code>-r</code>/<code>--replace</code> flag to substitute matched text in the printed output, useful for reformatting results</li><li>- The replacement string can reference capture groups by index (<code>$1</code>, <code>$2</code>) or by name (<code>$name</code>), allowing for powerful text transformations</li><li>- This feature does <strong>not</strong> modify files on disk; it only affects the output sent to stdout</li><li>- The replacement logic is handled by the <code>Replacer</code> utility within the <code>crates/printer</code> crate</li></ul>",
